  "title": "Li Qingzhao",
  "summary": "Born in 1084 in Jinan, Shandong, Li Qingzhao became a leading Song-dynasty poet, best known for ci lyrics. She married the scholar Zhao Mingcheng. After the Northern Song fell in 1127 the couple fled south of the Yangtze and lost most of their collections; he died in 1129. She spent her last years in Hangzhou.",
